==============================================================================
TLC-Bot Web Application Environment Variables
==============================================================================
Copy this file to '.env.local' or '.env' and fill in your actual credentials.
NEVER commit your '.env' file or hardcode secrets into client components!
── 1. GENERAL SITE CONFIGURATION ────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
NODE_ENV=development
── 2. DISCORD OAUTH2 CREDENTIALS (SERVER-SIDE ONLY) ─────────────────────────
Obtain these from https://discord.com/developers/applications
DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID_HERE
DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=YOUR_DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET_HERE
DISCORD_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback
── 3. SESSION SECURITY & COOKIE ENCRYPTION ─────────────────────────────────
Generate random 64-character strings for secret keys (e.g. using ⁠openssl rand -hex 32⁠)
COOKIE_SECRET=YOUR_SECURE_COOKIE_SECRET_STRING_HERE
JWT_SECRET=YOUR_SECURE_JWT_SECRET_STRING_HERE
── 4. TLC-BOT BACKEND INFRASTRUCTURE API ───────────────────────────────────
Connection details to communicate with your running Discord bot's API server
TLC_BOT_API_URL=https://api.tlcbot.internal
TLC_BOT_API_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_TLC_BOT_API_KEY_HERE
